{
  "$comment": "Open Geographies canonical Elasticsearch mapping: the index layer of the schema. One mapping serves every atlas. The fixed envelope and the promoted fields are explicit properties. A non-promoted relationship (a curator-named relationship with no canonical target) has no explicit property, so the uuid, record_id and name sub-fields of its summary object are matched by field name, wherever they occur, by the relationship_uuid, relationship_record_id and relationship_name dynamic templates below. Scalar user-defined fields (raw {label, value} objects keyed by their parameterized column name) get a *_facet companion only for Select fields (searchable.rb#user_defined_fields), mapped by the facets_as_keyword template in the same way as a taxonomy relationship's *_facet companion. Every query is filtered server-side on project_id and visibility, and documents from internal-intent fields are never written to this index.",

  "settings_comment": "searchkick_search and searchkick_search2 (under settings.analysis.analyzer) duplicate og_text instead of aliasing it. Passing a custom `settings:` to searchkick() (see V1::Searchable.searchable_index) replaces Searchkick's generated settings and does not merge with them, but Searchkick's query builder still uses those two analyzer names for any search term other than '*' (searchkick/query.rb). Without them, a text query fails with 'analyzer [searchkick_search] not found'. Keep all three in sync if og_text's tokenizer or filters change. This note is not a `$comment` key because `settings` is sent to Elasticsearch's index-settings API almost as written, and unknown setting keys are rejected.",

  "mappings_comment": "The `analyzed` multi-field on name, names, description, short_description and address exists for Searchkick's query builder. A `q` full-text search goes through Searchkick's `.search(term, fields: [...])`, which always targets `<field>.analyzed` for a plain field and never the bare field (see searchkick/query.rb#set_fields). A raw Elasticsearch client can query the bare field directly, since its analyzer is already og_text. This note is not a `$comment` key inside mappings.properties because every key under `properties` is a field name, and Elasticsearch rejects a field definition that is not a mapping object.",

  "slugs_comment": "Every `slug` has a `slugs` sibling, because base_search_data and summarize always emit both (slugs is the array of alternate URL slugs). `slugs` is mapped explicitly as a keyword. If it were not, it would fall through to the strings_as_text dynamic template and be analyzed as text, and the exact `where: { slugs: ... }` term filter that PlacesController#show uses to find a record by slug would match nothing.",

  "stops_comment": "stops holds `order` (the relationship row's own order column; see #with_relationship_order in searchable.rb) and `geo.point` (the geo_point that every Place-derived summary carries, from #extras). The mapping has to match what is actually written. Elasticsearch does not reject a declared shape that nothing produces, because dynamic mapping adds the real fields alongside it, so a mismatch shows up only as fields missing from every stop.",

  "order_comment": "`order` (media, works, people, places, map_layers, stops) is optional. It is the relationship row's own order column, and most relationships are never ordered, so it is nil. #with_relationship_order (searchable.rb) leaves the key out and does not write `order: null`, so a client should check whether the key is present. Items are already returned sorted by it (#related uses `.order(:order)`, and Postgres sorts nulls last, so unordered items come after ordered ones). `order` is included on each item so a client that filters, merges or re-sorts can recover the intended order.",

  "settings": {
    "analysis": {
      "analyzer": {
        "og_text": {
          "type": "custom",
          "tokenizer": "standard",
          "filter": ["lowercase", "asciifolding"]
        },
        "searchkick_search": {
          "type": "custom",
          "tokenizer": "standard",
          "filter": ["lowercase", "asciifolding"]
        },
        "searchkick_search2": {
          "type": "custom",
          "tokenizer": "standard",
          "filter": ["lowercase", "asciifolding"]
        }
      }
    }
  },

  "mappings": {
    "dynamic_templates": [
      {
        "facets_as_keyword": {
          "match": "*_facet",
          "mapping": { "type": "keyword", "ignore_above": 256 }
        }
      },
      {
        "relationship_uuid": {
          "match": "uuid",
          "match_mapping_type": "string",
          "mapping": { "type": "keyword" }
        }
      },
      {
        "relationship_record_id": {
          "match": "record_id",
          "match_mapping_type": "string",
          "mapping": { "type": "keyword" }
        }
      },
      {
        "relationship_name": {
          "match": "name",
          "match_mapping_type": "string",
          "mapping": {
            "type": "text",
            "analyzer": "og_text",
            "fields": { "keyword": { "type": "keyword", "ignore_above": 256 } }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "strings_as_text": {
          "match_mapping_type": "string",
          "mapping": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text" }
        }
      }
    ],

    "properties": {
      "uuid": { "type": "keyword" },
      "slug": { "type": "keyword" },
      "slugs": { "type": "keyword" },
      "project_id": { "type": "keyword" },
      "project": { "type": "keyword" },
      "model_type": { "type": "keyword" },
      "model_id": { "type": "keyword" },
      "model_name": { "type": "keyword" },

      "name": {
        "type": "text",
        "analyzer": "og_text",
        "fields": {
          "keyword": { "type": "keyword", "ignore_above": 256 },
          "analyzed": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text" }
        }
      },
      "names": {
        "type": "text",
        "analyzer": "og_text",
        "fields": { "analyzed": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text" } }
      },
      "description": {
        "type": "text",
        "analyzer": "og_text",
        "fields": { "analyzed": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text" } }
      },
      "short_description": {
        "type": "text",
        "analyzer": "og_text",
        "fields": { "analyzed": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text" } }
      },

      "visibility": { "type": "keyword" },
      "date_modified": { "type": "date" },
      "identifiers": {
        "properties": {
          "authority": { "type": "keyword" },
          "identifier": { "type": "keyword" }
        }
      },

      "geo": {
        "properties": {
          "point": { "type": "geo_point" },
          "shape": { "type": "geo_shape" }
        }
      },
      "geojson": { "type": "object", "enabled": false },
      "bbox": { "type": "double" },

      "administrative_area": {
        "properties": {
          "level": { "type": "keyword" },
          "name": { "type": "keyword" },
          "geonames_id": { "type": "keyword" },
          "geonames_url": { "type": "keyword", "index": false }
        }
      },

      "types": { "type": "keyword" },
      "contained_in_place": {
        "properties": {
          "uuid": { "type": "keyword" },
          "name": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slug": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slugs": { "type": "keyword" }
        }
      },
      "address": {
        "type": "text",
        "analyzer": "og_text",
        "fields": { "analyzed": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text" } }
      },
      "temporal_coverage": { "type": "date_range" },

      "media_type": { "type": "keyword" },
      "content_url": { "type": "keyword", "index": false },
      "embed_url": { "type": "keyword", "index": false },
      "thumbnail": { "type": "keyword", "index": false },
      "preview": { "type": "keyword", "index": false },
      "manifest_url": { "type": "keyword", "index": false },
      "encoding_format": { "type": "keyword" },
      "duration": { "type": "integer" },
      "caption": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text" },
      "alt_text": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text" },
      "content_warning": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text" },
      "upload_date": { "type": "date" },
      "featured": { "type": "boolean" },

      "url": { "type": "keyword", "index": false },
      "authors": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text", "fields": { "keyword": { "type": "keyword", "ignore_above": 256 } } },
      "date_published": { "type": "date" },
      "isbn": { "type": "keyword" },
      "work_type": { "type": "keyword" },

      "job_title": { "type": "keyword" },
      "affiliation": { "type": "keyword" },
      "birth_date": { "type": "date" },
      "death_date": { "type": "date" },

      "date": { "type": "date" },
      "bearing": { "type": "double" },
      "source": {
        "properties": {
          "type": { "type": "keyword" },
          "urls": { "type": "keyword", "index": false }
        }
      },

      "creator": {
        "properties": {
          "uuid": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slug": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slugs": { "type": "keyword" },
          "name": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text", "fields": { "keyword": { "type": "keyword", "ignore_above": 256 } } }
        }
      },
      "publisher": {
        "properties": {
          "uuid": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slug": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slugs": { "type": "keyword" },
          "name": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text", "fields": { "keyword": { "type": "keyword", "ignore_above": 256 } } }
        }
      },
      "vocabulary": { "type": "keyword" },
      "parent": {
        "properties": {
          "uuid": { "type": "keyword" },
          "name": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slug": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slugs": { "type": "keyword" }
        }
      },

      "featured_media": {
        "properties": {
          "uuid": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slug": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slugs": { "type": "keyword" },
          "name": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text" },
          "media_type": { "type": "keyword" },
          "thumbnail": { "type": "keyword", "index": false },
          "content_url": { "type": "keyword", "index": false },
          "embed_url": { "type": "keyword", "index": false }
        }
      },
      "media": {
        "properties": {
          "order": { "type": "integer" },
          "uuid": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slug": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slugs": { "type": "keyword" },
          "name": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text" },
          "media_type": { "type": "keyword" },
          "thumbnail": { "type": "keyword", "index": false },
          "content_url": { "type": "keyword", "index": false },
          "embed_url": { "type": "keyword", "index": false },
          "featured": { "type": "boolean" }
        }
      },
      "works": {
        "properties": {
          "order": { "type": "integer" },
          "uuid": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slug": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slugs": { "type": "keyword" },
          "name": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text" },
          "url": { "type": "keyword", "index": false },
          "work_type": { "type": "keyword" }
        }
      },
      "people": {
        "properties": {
          "order": { "type": "integer" },
          "uuid": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slug": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slugs": { "type": "keyword" },
          "name": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text", "fields": { "keyword": { "type": "keyword", "ignore_above": 256 } } }
        }
      },
      "places": {
        "properties": {
          "order": { "type": "integer" },
          "uuid": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slug": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slugs": { "type": "keyword" },
          "name": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text", "fields": { "keyword": { "type": "keyword", "ignore_above": 256 } } },
          "geo": { "properties": { "point": { "type": "geo_point" } } }
        }
      },
      "map_layers": {
        "properties": {
          "order": { "type": "integer" },
          "uuid": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slug": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slugs": { "type": "keyword" },
          "name": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text" },
          "date": { "type": "date" },
          "bbox": { "type": "geo_shape" },
          "source": {
            "properties": {
              "type": { "type": "keyword" },
              "urls": { "type": "keyword", "index": false }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "stops": {
        "properties": {
          "order": { "type": "integer" },
          "uuid": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slug": { "type": "keyword" },
          "slugs": { "type": "keyword" },
          "name": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "og_text" },
          "geo": { "properties": { "point": { "type": "geo_point" } } }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
